{% assign has_blocks = false %}
{% if section.blocks.size > 0 %}
  {% assign has_blocks = true %}
{% endif %}

<section class="faq-section" data-section-id="{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="faq-bg">
    {% if section.settings.background_image != blank %}
      <img src="{{ section.settings.background_image | image_url: width: 1920 }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
    {% else %}
      <img src="{{ 'faq-bg-pump.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <div class="faq-inner">
    <h2 class="faq-heading">{{ section.settings.heading | default: "FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS" }}</h2>

    <div class="faq-list">
      {% if has_blocks %}
        {% for block in section.blocks %}
          <div class="faq-item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="var item=this.parentElement;var wasOpen=item.classList.contains('is-open');document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item.is-open').forEach(function(el){el.classList.remove('is-open')});if(!wasOpen){item.classList.add('is-open')}">
              <span>{{ block.settings.question }}</span>
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <div class="faq-answer-inner">{{ block.settings.answer }}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      {% else %}
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="var item=this.parentElement;var wasOpen=item.classList.contains('is-open');document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item.is-open').forEach(function(el){el.classList.remove('is-open')});if(!wasOpen){item.classList.add('is-open')}">
            <span>How long until I see results?</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">Most men notice improved blood flow and fuller pumps within the first 7-14 days as L-Citrulline and L-Arginine boost nitric oxide levels. For sustained circulation, bedroom performance, and vascularity gains, expect noticeable results within 4-6 weeks of consistent use. Peak benefits build over 90 days as the full stack compounds.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="var item=this.parentElement;var wasOpen=item.classList.contains('is-open');document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item.is-open').forEach(function(el){el.classList.remove('is-open')});if(!wasOpen){item.classList.add('is-open')}">
            <span>Is this safe?</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">Absolutely. Pump Max is formulated with clinically-studied, natural ingredients that support your body's own nitric oxide production and circulation. It's manufactured in FDA-registered, GMP-certified facilities with third-party testing for purity and potency. Unlike prescription vasodilators, our formula works with your body's natural processes. Always consult your healthcare provider if you have specific health concerns.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="var item=this.parentElement;var wasOpen=item.classList.contains('is-open');document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item.is-open').forEach(function(el){el.classList.remove('is-open')});if(!wasOpen){item.classList.add('is-open')}">
            <span>Will this show up on drug tests?</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">No. Pump Max contains zero banned substances and will not trigger positive results on standard drug tests. All ingredients are natural, legal, and approved for use in professional and amateur athletics. Our formula supports natural nitric oxide production and blood flow rather than introducing synthetic compounds.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="var item=this.parentElement;var wasOpen=item.classList.contains('is-open');document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item.is-open').forEach(function(el){el.classList.remove('is-open')});if(!wasOpen){item.classList.add('is-open')}">
            <span>Can I take this with other supplements?</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">Pump Max is designed to work synergistically with other supplements — it pairs especially well with Chad Bites for a complete performance stack. However, if you're taking blood pressure medications or vasodilators, consult your doctor first.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="var item=this.parentElement;var wasOpen=item.classList.contains('is-open');document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item.is-open').forEach(function(el){el.classList.remove('is-open')});if(!wasOpen){item.classList.add('is-open')}">
            <span>Why gummies instead of pills?</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">Gummies offer superior bioavailability because they begin absorption in the mouth through the mucous membranes. They're also more enjoyable to take, which means better compliance and consistency. Plus, you actually look forward to taking them instead of choking down horse pills. Taste matters when you're building a daily habit.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="var item=this.parentElement;var wasOpen=item.classList.contains('is-open');document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item.is-open').forEach(function(el){el.classList.remove('is-open')});if(!wasOpen){item.classList.add('is-open')}">
            <span>How many gummies are in each bottle?</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">Each bottle contains 60 gummies, which is a full 30-day supply at the recommended dose of 2 gummies per day. This ensures you get consistent daily support for optimal nitric oxide production and blood flow throughout the month.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="var item=this.parentElement;var wasOpen=item.classList.contains('is-open');document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item.is-open').forEach(function(el){el.classList.remove('is-open')});if(!wasOpen){item.classList.add('is-open')}">
            <span>What if it doesn't work for me?</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">We stand behind our product with a 90-day money-back guarantee. If you don't feel a noticeable difference in your circulation, pumps, or performance, simply contact our team for a full refund. No questions asked, no hassle. We're confident you'll experience the benefits, but if not, you risk nothing.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="var item=this.parentElement;var wasOpen=item.classList.contains('is-open');document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item.is-open').forEach(function(el){el.classList.remove('is-open')});if(!wasOpen){item.classList.add('is-open')}">
            <span>Do I need to cycle this?</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">No cycling necessary. Unlike synthetic vasodilators, Pump Max contains natural ingredients that support your body's own nitric oxide production without dependency. You can take it daily, year-round, without the need for breaks or tapering.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="var item=this.parentElement;var wasOpen=item.classList.contains('is-open');document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item.is-open').forEach(function(el){el.classList.remove('is-open')});if(!wasOpen){item.classList.add('is-open')}">
            <span>Can I take more than 2 gummies per day?</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">The recommended dose is 2 gummies per day for optimal results. This dosage has been carefully formulated to provide effective nitric oxide and blood flow support while staying within safe ranges. Taking more than the recommended amount won't necessarily accelerate results and isn't advised. Consistency at the proper dose is key.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="var item=this.parentElement;var wasOpen=item.classList.contains('is-open');document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item.is-open').forEach(function(el){el.classList.remove('is-open')});if(!wasOpen){item.classList.add('is-open')}">
            <span>Is this suitable for men over 50?</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">Yes, absolutely. In fact, men over 50 often experience the most dramatic benefits because nitric oxide production naturally declines with age. Pump Max is specifically formulated to help mature men restore healthy blood flow and circulation naturally. Many of our most enthusiastic customers are in their 50s, 60s, and beyond, reporting renewed stamina, pumps, and bedroom performance.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ - Pump Max",
  "class": "faq-section-wrapper",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "background_image",
      "label": "Background image"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "faq_item",
      "name": "FAQ Item",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "question",
          "label": "Question",
          "default": "Question?"
        },
        {
          "type": "textarea",
          "id": "answer",
          "label": "Answer",
          "default": "Answer text here."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "FAQ"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
